        </div>
        <h3>We scan everything</h3>
        <p>Every week our AI monitors 50+ sources — Product Hunt, newsletters, Reddit — for new AI tools worth your time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="how-item">
        <div class="how-icon" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);color:#34d399">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path d="M9 12l-3-3 1.4-1.4L9 9.2l4.6-4.6L15 6l-6 6z"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16z" clip-rule="evenodd" opacity=".3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Claude picks the best</h3>
        <p>Claude AI filters out the hype and selects the 3 tools most useful for small business owners that week.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="how-item">
        <div class="how-icon" style="background:rgba(249,115,22,0.15);color:#fb923c">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path d="M2.003 5.884L10 9.882l7.997-3.998A2 2 0 0016 4H4a2 2 0 00-1.997 1.884z"/><path d="M18 8.118l-8 4-8-4V14a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8.118z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Lands in your inbox</h3>
        <p>Every Monday at 8am: a short email, three tools, one practical tip. Read it in under 2 minutes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── LATEST ISSUE ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
